# ——— FURITEN ———

msgid "Furiten"
msgstr "Furiten"

msgid "Impossible ron"
msgstr "Impossible ron"

msgid "Furiten is a rule that prohibits you from winning on the discard of opponents (Ron) in 3 different situations:"
msgstr "Furiten is a rule that prohibits you from winning on the discard of opponents (Ron) in 3 different situations:"

msgid "Own discard"
msgstr "Own discard"

msgid "If you have <b>already discarded any tile that could complete your hand</b>, you remain furiten until you change your waiting tile(s)."
msgstr "If you have <b>already discarded any tile that could complete your hand</b>, you remain furiten until you change your waiting tile(s)."

msgid "Other discards"
msgstr "Other discards"

msgid "If you <b>let pass a tile that can complete your hand</b>, you remain furiten until your next draw, or until your next call."
msgstr "If you <b>let pass a tile that can complete your hand</b>, you remain furiten until your next draw, or until your next call."

msgid "After a Riichi"
msgstr "After a Riichi"

msgid "If you <b>let pass a tile that can complete your hand once you have announced a Riichi</b>, you remain furiten until the end of the game."
msgstr "If you <b>let pass a tile that can complete your hand once you have announced a Riichi</b>, you remain furiten until the end of the game."

